{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Description:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into &quot;Wonderland Space&quot; and embark on a series of level types centered around the &quot;core&quot; as the main background. The game itself is themed around &quot;pool core+dream&quot;. Use your eyes, ears, and hands to decrypt and explore in this imaginative three-dimensional space</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a special statement from the developer to the player:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to purchase, download, and play the game. All experiences can be described in the comments section. This version is only the first development version and was developed by the author himself. If you have any innovative gameplay/ideas or more optimization suggestions/opinions for the game, please feel free to share them in the comments section. I will work hard to update and optimize the game according to each player's true thoughts, and welcome every player who is willing to come here. There are more gameplay and new experiences constantly being updated. Thank you very much for your support of this work!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3257650?t=1757080312","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257650/8e54999cc32e24eab84e9bcbd6e3285192138492/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757080312","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257650/33c9416d01ecec859a8eeb2375ef5e84842049d0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757080312","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257650/33c9416d01ecec859a8eeb2375ef5e84842049d0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757080312","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_para